      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6;">Zonke izingcingo ezibalulwe ngenhla zimahhala kuma-landline nakwiningi lezinkampani zeselula. I-SADAG inayo nomugqa wengxoxo we-WhatsApp — thumela u-"Hi" ku-076 882 2775 ngamahora omsebenzi.</p>
